DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: Okay.

asr-000672
00:31:26.760 --> 00:31:30.240
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: The Office of the Presidential Adviser on Peace, Reconciliation

asr-000673
00:31:31.080 --> 00:31:41.780
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: and Unity approached us through DOST Region XII, asking if we were willing to help them

asr-000674
00:31:42.279 --> 00:31:47.379
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: solve the issues that they have in helping the former combatants in

asr-000675
00:31:48.960 --> 00:31:53.219
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: BARMM, and we decided, for the first phase,

asr-000676
00:31:53.799 --> 00:32:02.919
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: to help six former MILF camps. One is to address the lack of potable water. Second is to do the

asr-000677
00:32:02.919 --> 00:32:09.639
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: interventions for livelihood so we have catfish production and they use

asr-000678
00:32:09.639 --> 00:32:15.360
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: purified water out of the SAFEWATRS that we developed. The DOST-ITDI developed

asr-000679
00:32:15.360 --> 00:32:20.000
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: it. It's cost-effective, very easy to use. You just replace the membrane, mag-order

asr-000680
00:32:20.000 --> 00:32:25.779
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: ka lang sa Lazada or Shopee. Palitan mo lang iyon, madali.

asr-000681
00:32:26.600 --> 00:32:32.520
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: So tuwang-tuwa na sila doon kasi they can use it for drinking and, of course, for raising the catfish.

asr-000682
00:32:33.039 --> 00:32:37.859
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: Also halal production of bread—

asr-000683
00:32:38.440 --> 00:32:44.000
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: pinakamasarap na pandesal na natikman ko sa Camp Sarmiento—and also weaving.

asr-000684
00:32:44.320 --> 00:32:50.880
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: We provided them satellite Starlink and library in a box

asr-000685
00:32:51.360 --> 00:32:53.760
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: so that the kids would also be able to learn.

asr-000686
00:32:53.760 --> 00:32:59.320
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: So I think what we need to do is

asr-000687
00:32:59.320 --> 00:33:04.039
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: provide them the opportunity to use science and technology and really solve

asr-000688
00:33:04.039 --> 00:33:13.480
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: their basic needs water livelihood even clothing if possible and we will have

asr-000689
00:33:13.480 --> 00:33:20.039
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: another phase. This is the concept that we have: if we develop conflict areas using

asr-000690
00:33:20.039 --> 00:33:24.720
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: science technology and innovation then people will believe that they can

asr-000691
00:33:24.720 --> 00:33:29.960
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: actually uplift their own lives and eventually because of their preoccupation

asr-000692
00:33:29.960 --> 00:33:35.279
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: to really improving their lives, they would be more focused on peace.

asr-000693
00:33:35.279 --> 00:33:44.919
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: They wanted to really experience a life that is really good. Ayaw naman nila ng conflict.

asr-000694
00:33:44.919 --> 00:33:50.240
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: The real issue now is to provide them the opportunity and for them to trust

asr-000695
00:33:50.240 --> 00:33:55.360
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: our intervention. Yun po yung kailangan eh. Hindi ka puwedeng magbigay lang ng

asr-000696
