DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: technology intervention tapos iiwanan mo. Minsan iyan ang problem ng development

asr-000697
00:34:00.639 --> 00:34:04.559
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: partners kasi wala naman sila doon sa baba. Puwede silang tumulong, but

asr-000698
