asr-001227
01:07:58.920 --> 01:08:08.559
DBM Budget and Management Bureau-F Director Vivien V. Labastilla: projects of attached agencies under the DOST that were previously funded under the GIA

asr-001228
01:08:08.559 --> 01:08:15.839
DBM Budget and Management Bureau-F Director Vivien V. Labastilla: of ASEC Councils directly to the agency-specific budgets of the DOST.

asr-001229
01:08:16.400 --> 01:08:26.540
DBM Budget and Management Bureau-F Director Vivien V. Labastilla: So as such, the GIA will primarily fund those R&amp;D projects proposed by external stakeholders

asr-001230
01:08:27.000 --> 01:08:32.560
DBM Budget and Management Bureau-F Director Vivien V. Labastilla: such as the HEIs and other NGAs and private institutions.

asr-001231
01:08:33.080 --> 01:08:41.799
DBM Budget and Management Bureau-F Director Vivien V. Labastilla: So this process, the reallocation of funding to the attached agencies of the DOST, will

asr-001232
01:08:41.799 --> 01:08:49.239
